-- SPDX-License-Identifier: FSL-1.1-ALv2
-- An organisation being deleted (modules/org/purge/). Set once, at the start of
-- the deletion; from then on every request for the org answers 410 and the job
-- dispatch drops its jobs, and the kernel immutability trigger (generated by
-- modules/apps/ddl.ts, applied at app registration) lets the purge delete the
-- org's legal records. The trigger change lives in the generator, not here: a
-- release that changes ddl.ts re-applies every app's DDL once.
--
-- Nullable, no default: every existing org is live (NULL), and the previous
-- release, which never reads or writes it, keeps working during a deploy.
-- Re-runnable.
-- A catalog-only change, but every org read queues behind an ALTER waiting for
-- a long transaction: fail fast and retry the deploy instead.
SET LOCAL lock_timeout = '5s';
--> statement-breakpoint
ALTER TABLE kernel.organizations ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS deleting_at timestamptz;
